in=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg>Call <!-- -->(206) 407-6291</a></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"card-grid\"><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Connected living spaces in a cohesive whole-home renovation\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/img-hmr-01.webp 384w, /images/img-hmr-01.webp 640w, /images/img-hmr-01.webp 750w, /images/img-hmr-01.webp 828w, /images/img-hmr-01.webp 1080w, /images/img-hmr-01.webp 1200w, /images/img-hmr-01.webp 1920w, /images/img-hmr-01.webp 2048w, /images/img-hmr-01.webp 3840w\" src=\"/images/img-hmr-01.webp\"></figure><div class=\"service-card-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">whole-home remodeling</p><h3>Whole-Home Remodeling</h3><p>A successful full-home renovation is more than a series of room updates. RT Signature Homes coordinates layout, structure, building systems, materials, permits, and construction sequencing so the finished home feels intentional from one space to the next.</p><a href=\"/services/home-remodeling/\">Explore <!-- -->home remodeling<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Functional premium kitchen with warm cabinetry and generous work surfaces\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/img-kit-01.webp 384w, /images/img-kit-01.webp 640w, /images/img-kit-01.webp 750w, /images/img-kit-01.webp 828w, /images/img-kit-01.webp 1080w, /images/img-kit-01.webp 1200w, /images/img-kit-01.webp 1920w, /images/img-kit-01.webp 2048w, /images/img-kit-01.webp 3840w\" src=\"/images/img-kit-01.webp\"></figure><div class=\"service-card-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">kitchen remodeling contractor</p><h3>Kitchen Remodeling</h3><p>RT Signature Homes approaches kitchen remodeling as a balance of circulation, storage, work zones, lighting, materials, and construction reality. Every visible finish depends on decisions behind the walls and inside the cabinets.</p><a href=\"/services/kitchen-remodeling/\">Explore <!-- -->kitchen remodeling<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Refined bathroom with natural materials and a calm spa-like layout\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/img-bath-01.webp 384w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 640w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 750w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 828w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 1080w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 1200w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 1920w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 2048w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 3840w\" src=\"/images/img-bath-01.webp\"></figure><div class=\"service-card-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">bathroom remodeling contractor</p><h3>Bathroom Remodeling</h3><p>Bathrooms concentrate plumbing, ventilation, electrical work, tile, cabinetry, glass, and moisture control in a compact footprint. RT Signature Homes plans those systems together so the room performs as well as it looks.</p><a href=\"/services/bathroom-remodeling/\">Explore <!-- -->bathroom remodeling<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Residential addition integrated with the original home's architecture\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/img-add-01.webp 384w, /images/img-add-01.webp 640w, /images/img-add-01.webp 750w, /images/img-add-01.webp 828w, /images/img-add-01.webp 1080w, /images/img-add-01.webp 1200w, /images/img-add-01.webp 1920w, /images/img-add-01.webp 2048w, /images/img-add-01.webp 3840w\" src=\"/images/img-add-01.webp\"></figure><div class=\"service-card-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">home addition contractor</p><h3>Home Additions</h3><p>An addition changes the structure, exterior, utilities, circulation, and relationship between old and new. RT Signature Homes coordinates those decisions as a single design-build scope.</p><a href=\"/services/home-additions/\">Explore <!-- -->home additions<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Detached backyard ADU designed for a Pacific Northwest property\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/img-adu-01.webp 384w, /images/img-adu-01.webp 640w, /images/img-adu-01.webp 750w, /images/img-adu-01.webp 828w, /images/img-adu-01.webp 1080w, /images/img-adu-01.webp 1200w, /images/img-adu-01.webp 1920w, /images/img-adu-01.webp 2048w, /images/img-adu-01.webp 3840w\" src=\"/images/img-adu-01.webp\"></figure><div class=\"service-card-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">ADU builder</p><h3>ADU Design &amp; Construction</h3><p>Accessory dwelling units require careful coordination of zoning, access, utilities, privacy, parking, structure, and compact-space design. RT Signature Homes brings feasibility, permitting, and construction into one process.</p><a href=\"/services/adu-builder/\">Explore <!-- -->adus<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Custom Pacific Northwest home with restrained contemporary materials\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/img-custom-01.webp 384w, /images/img-custom-01.webp 640w, /images/img-custom-01.webp 750w, /images/img-custom-01.webp 828w, /images/img-custom-01.webp 1080w, /images/img-custom-01.webp 1200w, /images/img-custom-01.webp 1920w, /images/img-custom-01.webp 2048w, /images/img-custom-01.webp 3840w\" src=\"/images/img-custom-01.webp\"></figure><div class=\"service-card-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">custom home builder</p><h3>Custom Home Building</h3><p>A custom home is a sequence of thousands of connected decisions. RT Signature Homes organizes feasibility, design, selections, permitting, estimating, construction, and closeout around a single accountable delivery process.</p><a href=\"/services/custom-home-builder/\">Explore <!-- -->custom homes<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Coordinated exterior renovation with roofing, siding, windows, and deck\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/img-ext-01.webp 384w, /images/img-ext-01.webp 640w, /images/img-ext-01.webp 750w, /images/img-ext-01.webp 828w, /images/img-ext-01.webp 1080w, /images/img-ext-01.webp 1200w, /images/img-ext-01.webp 1920w, /images/img-ext-01.webp 2048w, /images/img-ext-01.webp 3840w\" src=\"/images/img-ext-01.webp\"></figure><div class=\"service-card-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">exterior remodeling</p><h3>Exterior Remodeling</h3><p>Exterior remodeling should improve weather protection, durability, transitions, drainage, access, and appearance together. RT Signature Homes combines related exterior scopes so one change does not create a problem somewhere else.</p><a href=\"/services/exterior-remodeling/\">Explore <!-- -->exterior remodeling<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Finished hardwood flooring in a warm residential interior\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/img-flr-01.webp 384w, /images/img-flr-01.webp 640w, /images/img-flr-01.webp 750w, /images/img-flr-01.webp 828w, /images/img-flr-01.webp 1080w, /images/img-flr-01.webp 1200w, /images/img-flr-01.webp 1920w, /images/img-flr-01.webp 2048w, /images/img-flr-01.webp 3840w\" src=\"/images/img-flr-01.webp\"></figure><div class=\"service-card-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">flooring contractor</p><h3>Flooring Installation &amp; Refinishing</h3><p>RT Signature Homes coordinates flooring material, subfloor conditions, moisture, transitions, trim, room use, and construction sequencing. Installation quality begins before the first visible b